  ELSEIF DaylightSavings==0 && DayOfWeek==1 && Hour==7 && {b61ccdd3-7d6f-4b97-8797-82ef49a46e58}<23.9 && {b61ccdd3-7d6f-4b97-8797-82ef49a46e58}>1.7, !- Program Line 4
